graph TD
    push([Push to branch]) --> lint[Run lint]
    lint --> unit[Unit tests]
    unit --> passed{All pass?}
    passed -- No --> notify[Notify the author]
    notify --> fin([Stop])
    passed -- Yes --> build[Build image]
    build --> scan[Security scan]
    scan --> vuln{Critical vulnerability?}
    vuln -- Yes --> notify
    vuln -- No --> staging[Deploy staging]
    staging --> e2e[E2E tests]
    e2e --> e2eok{OK?}
    e2eok -- No --> rollback[Rollback staging]
    rollback --> notify
    e2eok -- Yes --> approve{Approve production?}
    approve -- Not yet --> wait[Wait approval]
    wait --> approve
    approve -- Approved --> prod([Deploy production])
